// One template for both launcher and in-canvas workflow switching.
export global CharacterAgePreset {
    out property <string> prompt-zh: "根据参考角色生成从婴儿到老年的{count}个连续年龄阶段，作为日常、非性化的角色设定图。默认第一阶段为0至1岁婴儿，穿完整、不透明的长袖连体衣，采用自然坐姿或躺姿；后续依次成长为儿童、少年、青年、中年和老年。根据数量均匀选取中间年龄，保留婴儿起点和老年终点；用户明确指定年龄范围时按其范围生成。参考图用于延续面部辨识特征、发色、主配色和绘制风格，不直接复制不适合相应年龄的成人服装、姿势或道具。所有年龄阶段均穿着得体、完整、不透明且符合年龄的日常服装，婴儿和儿童使用舒适、宽松的衣着。通过自然的面部特征、身高比例和服装尺寸表现年龄差异。完整展示指穿着衣物的角色外轮廓及衣物、头发和配饰不被画面边缘裁切，不要求展示衣物覆盖的身体部位。各角色完整独立、均匀排列，主体与衣物互不接触、不重叠，保留清晰的纯色背景空隙以便抠图。";
    out property <string> prompt-en: "Create exactly {count} consecutive age stages of the reference character from infancy to old age as an everyday, non-sexual character design sheet. By default, begin with a 0-to-1-year-old baby wearing a complete opaque long-sleeved one-piece outfit in a natural sitting or lying pose, followed by childhood, adolescence, young adulthood, middle age and old age. Sample intermediate ages evenly for the selected count, retaining the baby start and elderly endpoint; honor a different age range only when explicitly requested by the user. Use the reference for recognizable facial features, hair color, primary palette and art style, not to copy adult clothing, poses or props that are inappropriate for the depicted age. Every stage wears complete, opaque, age-appropriate everyday clothing; babies and children wear comfortable loose-fitting outfits. Convey age through natural facial features, height proportions and clothing sizes. Complete presentation means the clothed character silhouette, clothing, hair and accessories remain inside the canvas, not that body parts covered by clothing should be exposed. Arrange complete independent characters evenly with clear solid-background gaps for individual cutouts; characters and clothing must not touch or overlap.";
}
